2026-08-09: Profiled immutable evaluator mechanics, task split distributions, graph endpoint resolution, known-user activity coverage, and daily panel throughput. Added PLAN.md and eval_profile.md at repository root because the provided kapso_evaluation directory is read-only and protected from candidate edits.
2026-08-09: Implemented exact daily label reconstruction, static directed/symmetric graph views, normalized SVD, structural and community features, censored temporal propagation, compact history and cold LightGBM experts, purged forward selection, deterministic history gating, slice diagnostics, and separate Model A/Model B fits. The debug pipeline passed the prediction contract in 28.9 seconds with exact train reconstruction.
2026-08-09: Registered full evaluation completed in 98.6 seconds and archived as run_0001. Internal purged selection kept 16 SVD dimensions with hard zero-history routing and rejected the 32-dimensional/community comparators; official validation roc_auc=0.8448104817496305. No external datasets or pretrained models were used.
2026-08-09: Internal importance audit found that non-community cold variants still admitted four `rank_community_*` columns because only raw `community_*` prefixes were excluded. Tightened the comparator mask so community-derived ranks enter only the explicitly community-enabled variant; run_0001 remains temporally valid but its SVD-16 label represented a partial rather than zero-community block.
2026-08-09: Forward-only refinements removed noisy direct content/location-hash columns from the history expert and widened the cold expert's full-weight sparse range from at most 2 to at most 5 prior invitations. The four non-overlapping purged origins improved from history mean/std 0.89082/0.04963 to 0.89366/0.04580 and selected-graph mean/std 0.89689/0.03867.
2026-08-09: Rejected time decay, repeat-user weighting, reduced daily cadence, linear history, short-horizon RFM, directed propagation, demographic cohort priors, count-weighted label propagation, Louvain resolution 0.5, cold feature pruning, and cold-logit calibration using only training-era forward results. Added compact forward slice aggregates and corrected isolated-node reporting to use the symmetric resolved adjacency.
2026-08-09: Rejected six explicit neighbor-observation coverage features after their best graph mixture reached forward mean AUC 0.89567 versus 0.89689 for the frozen compact graph mixture. Restored the precommitted feature version before final evaluation.
2026-08-09: Final registered full evaluation completed in 54.6 seconds and archived as run_0006 with official validation roc_auc=0.8383545857654633. Both archived arrays passed the local shape, range, dtype, and finiteness contract checks.
